sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cycle as ooda_loop::cycle
  participant Prep as memory_consolidation::preparation
  participant Ops as CognitiveMemoryOps
  participant Client as RemoteCognitiveMemory
  participant Server as memory_ipc::server
  participant Store as LibraryCognitiveMemory lbug
  participant Prompt as OODA prompt context

  Cycle->>Cycle: build_objective_probe(active goals)
  Cycle->>Prep: preparation_memory_operations_with_active_slugs_phased(objective, active_slugs, observe weights)
  Prep->>Ops: recall_facts_ranked(fragment, 10, 0.0, weights)
  Ops->>Client: MemoryRequest via trait implementation when remote
  Client->>Server: framed JSON request over Unix socket
  Server->>Store: dispatch to lbug-backed memory
  Store-->>Prep: ranked CognitiveFact candidates
  Prep->>Prep: filter goal-board:snapshot and round-robin fragments
  Prep->>Ops: search_facts(goal-store:record, limit, 0.0)
  Store-->>Prep: latest goal records by slug
  Prep->>Ops: check_triggers(objective)
  Prep->>Prep: tokenize_objective(objective)
  Prep->>Ops: recall_procedure(token, 5) per token
  Prep->>Ops: recall_episodes_ranked(tokens, 5, weights)
  Store-->>Prep: facts + prospects + procedures + episodes
  Prep->>Ops: push_working(context-summary)
  Prep-->>Cycle: PreparedContext
  Cycle->>Prompt: store context for orient/decide/act prompts
